Client2 .&gt; Façade : doSomething()
note as N2
doSomething() {
 Class1 c1 = newClass1();
 Class2 c2 = newClass2();
 Class3 c3 = newClass3();
 c1.doStuff(c2)
 c3.setX(c1.getX());
 return c3.getY();
end note
